{21}{[Last entry, Jan 27, 2110]}{}{1}{}{30}{}
{22}{[Jan 23, 2110]}{}{1}{}{40}{}
{23}{[Log off.]}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{30}{I fear this shall be my last entry into this log. Something bizarre is happening here, something terrible. Liebert, my god he was always a bit distanced, but I had no idea he could be capable of what he has wrought here...}{}{1}{}{}{}
{31}{[more]}{}{1}{}{34}{}
{32}{[back]}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{34}{This disease is no natural thing, but a concoction of Liebert's, designed to weaken us. We had no idea he had so many of those blasted robots assembled! His nano-virus has already killed four of us, and in the meantime Liebert has taken virtually total control of the facility.}{This disease is no natural thing, but a concoction of Liebert's, designed to weaken us. We had no idea he had so many of those blasted robots assembled! His nano-virus has already killed four of us, and in the meantime Liebert has taken virtually total control of the facility.}{}{}{}{}
{35}{[more]}{}{1}{}{37}{}
{36}{[back]}{}{1}{}{30}{}
{37}{As a last measure before this illness or one of his metal horrors claims my life, I'm activating the prototype TPU. I'll be damned if Liebert is going to get all my research and technology without a fight.}{As a last measure before this illness or one of his metal horrors claims my life, I'm activating the prototype TPU. I'll be damned if Liebert is going to get all my research and technology without a fight.}{}{}{}{}
{38}{[done]}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{40}{My work with energy fields progresses. The new security fields we installed upstairs seem to be working splendidly, and as long as its generators are running, the CommSec is virtually impenetrable when the field is activated. The security team has fallen all over themselves thanking me, and they can't wait for the more compact version. I'm calling it the TPU- Trespassing Prevention Unit.}{My work with energy fields progresses. The new security fields we installed upstairs seem to be working splendidly, and as long as its generators are running, the CommSec is virtually impenetrable when the field is activated. The security team has fallen all over themselves thanking me, and they can't wait for the more compact version. I'm calling it the TPU- Trespassing Prevention Unit.}{}{}{}{}
{41}{[more]}{}{1}{}{44}{}
{42}{[back]}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{43}{On a strange note, several people have reported illness today. I wonder if there could be something going around... ah well. Oh, note to self: remember to move the TPU research notes into the secure office. I shouldn't leave them lying around my desk. }{On a strange note, several people have reported illness today. I wonder if there could be something going around... ah well. Oh, note to self: remember to move the TPU research notes into the secure office. I shouldn't leave them lying around my desk.}{}{}{}{}
{44}{[done]}{}{1}{}{20}{}
